# INVWINH.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: new items.  INS
# shows a new item with INV's first values, which ESC leaves untouched
# without asking, as Items > New item does; a new item at a location
# that does not exist is refused, the message under the fields and the
# focus on the location; mended, it is added, and the list fetched again
# holds it; the end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINH.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K INS
S NEW
K ESC
S NEWESC
K ALT-I N
S MENUNEW
# category SYS, maker Compaq, location ZZ: refused, on the location
T SYS
K ALT-M
T Compaq
K ALT-L
T ZZ
K ENTER
S REFUSED
T A1
K ENTER
S ADDED
K END
S END
K ALT-F X
